# Keep secrets, local-only tools and dev clutter out of the deployed site
# (everything copied into the image is publicly served by Apache).
.git
.serena
graphify-out
reference
claude

TechPrime-AI/.env
TechPrime-AI/vendor
TechPrime-AI/graphify-out
TechPrime-AI/CLIENT.zip
TechPrime-AI/ml
# ...except the Build a PC Random Forest, which includes/pc_recommend.php reads at runtime
